Task 9: Set Java as the default alternative if the format is targz, the distribution is not Alpine, and the vendor is Oracle.  
Description Task 9: Configure the system to use Oracle Java as the default alternative for the `java` command when the format is targz, the distribution is not Alpine, and the vendor is Oracle.

Task 10: Determine the JAVA_HOME directory by finding the real path of the Java binary.  
Description Task 10: Execute a shell command to determine the JAVA_HOME directory by finding the real path of the Java binary.

Task 11: Set the JAVA_HOME environment variable in `/etc/profile.d/java_home.sh`.  
